SlothClash core patch 0045: finalmask, the compact xdns spelling.

"<domain>[:<method>]+udp://<server>" resolvers and "<domain>[:<method>]"
zones, as the first Xray xdns (v26.1.31 to v26.9.9) and the panels of that
time write them, with that client's wire (DNSTT framing, polls doubling
from 500 ms to 10 s, resolver rotation); the structured form speaks the
current wire. The two spellings do not mix; compact zones on an inbound are
refused.

Ported from Prizrak-Core v1.19.34-r4.
Delete with 0044.

Tests: transport/finalmask/xdns, transport/finalmask/option.

